{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2025/0730/c79319a3072286/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.650947+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2025/0730/c79319a3072286/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>浙江大学推荐免试研究生申请报名系统于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日开放，详情请查看《浙江大学关于</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知》 </span><span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm</span></a></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></span><span>欢迎全国院校优秀应届本科生申请攻读浙江大学生命科学学院推荐免试直博生。生命科学学院推荐免试直博生申请系统开放时间为</span><strong><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span><span>至</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日</span><span>22:</span><span>00</span></strong><span>，逾期不候。报名入口：</span><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2025/0730/c79319a3072286/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login </span></span></a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2025/0730/c79319a3072286/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><br/></span></span></a></p><p><strong><span>报名时请将以下</span><span>1-6</span><span>申请材料的扫描件按顺序制作成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>上传报名系统：</span></strong></p><p><span>  1.</span><span>《</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/a8593ee6d6e14ec8bd28.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/41/6f/3a27f07e4bca9a4168a600a7504f/d3f8af0a-1a6a-4797-ac17-017b1a708bc2.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生命科学学院2026年推荐免试直博生报名申请表.docx</a><span></span><span>》</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></p><p><span>  2.</span><span>身份证正反扫描件</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></p><p><span>  3.</span><span>个人简历</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></p><p><span>  4.</span><span>本科成绩单</span><span>1</span><span>份及总成绩排名</span><span>1</span><span>份（须加盖院系或学校教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>  5.</span><span>英语六级或</span><span>GRE</span><span>或托福或雅思等外语成绩证书扫描件</span><span>1</span><span>份（要求：全国大学英语六级</span><span>≥460 </span><span>或托福</span><span>≥80 </span><span>或雅思</span><span>≥5.5 </span><span>或</span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）合格或英语专业八级合格或英语国家获得过学士及以上学位）；</span></p><p><span>  6.</span><span>其他获奖证明材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>  </span></span><span>其他说明：</span></strong></p><p><span>  1.</span><span>我院推荐免试生招考只招收</span><span>5</span><span>年制直博生；</span></p><p><span>  2.</span><span>考生需提供</span><span>2</span><span>份电子版的《</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/a8593ee6d6e14ec8bd28.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/41/6f/3a27f07e4bca9a4168a600a7504f/ab126ef7-89d1-4718-8a0e-749d6392d46f.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书.doc</a><span></span><span>》，接收邮箱：</span><span>345179149@qq.com </span><span>。电子版需是专家签字后的扫描件或推荐书内有专家电子签名；邮件命名：</span><span>2026</span><span>年推免直博报名</span><span>+</span><span>考生姓名</span><span>+</span><span>专家推荐书；</span></p><p><span><span>  </span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>获得我院</span><span>2025</span><span>年夏令营 </span><span>“</span><span>优秀营员</span><span>”</span><span>的考生也需要按此通知进行正式报名；</span></span></p><p><span><span>  </span><span>4.</span></span><span>有意向报考的本校考生也请通过此系统报名；</span></p><p><span>  5.</span><span>报考</span><strong><span>生命科学研究院</span></strong><span>（独立招生）的同学请关注该院官网通知；</span></p><p><span> 6.</span><span>研究生科联系人：陈老师，联系电话：</span><span>0571-88206488</span><span>，联系邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:sinohui84@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>sinohui84@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>                                                                                                                   </span></span><span>生命科学学院</span></p><p><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"151573b1524db02f9e0581e111217b482d20390e4dd204c251901944c0fe14e7","textLength":809,"sourceSha256":"51c45d5091e29def36d427893c3e48ac24858a3d4898b9ab07062c7e54c0f820","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0bf49b89a23834e1a5d6","title":"2025年浙江大学生命科学学院关于接收2026年外校及本校推荐免试直博生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.650947+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/a8593ee6d6e14ec8bd28.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/a8593ee6d6e14ec8bd28.gif"}]}
